<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cemenco yr share sags, dividend down.</title>
<headline>Cemenco yr share sags, dividend down.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     78.7     vs   95.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 22.5     vs   26.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    7.04    vs    8.53</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   14.51    vs   13.47</p>
<p>    Tax			  7.06    vs    4.89</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    5.87    vs    3.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		 549.60    vs  407.09</p>
<p>Div payable: February 26</p>
<p>on register: January 31</p>
<p>Full name: The Cementation Company (Africa) Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors have resolved to award capitalisation shares, the terms of which will be announced at a later date.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
